#: ../../../driver-api/pci/pci:4: ../drivers/pci/pci.c:535
msgid ""
"``PCI_EXT_CAP_ID_ERR``         Advanced Error Reporting "
"``PCI_EXT_CAP_ID_VC``          Virtual Channel "
"``PCI_EXT_CAP_ID_DSN``         Device Serial Number "
"``PCI_EXT_CAP_ID_PWR``         Power Budgeting"
msgstr ""

